E018 -- innate auditory reflex, 8 matched seeds, 16 hens, 30 min rearing

audience effect = alarm calling with flockmates in earshot, minus alone.
The scaffold wires a response to *hearing* a call and touches nothing on
the production side, so it should not move this column on its own.

condition                   audience  compreh.  strikes/hen   hunger  synapses
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
N   (bare, fixed)             +0.003   -0.0001       432.45    0.334     36319
S   (scaffold, fixed)         +0.066    0.1921       384.81    0.321     36319
N+L (bare, learning)          +0.001   -0.0001       595.45    0.310     35722
S+L (scaffold, learning)      +0.061    0.1894       417.77    0.329     35724

--- PRIMARY: what learning adds on top of the wiring -------------------
audience effect, S+L - S        -0.005 +/- 0.003 SE   suggestive (t=1.53, need 2.37)
  positive = she learned to call more when someone is listening, over and
  above anything the scaffold gave her. This is the only learned number here.

--- MANIPULATION CHECK (not a result) ----------------------------------
comprehension, bare      fixed   -0.0001   <- expected ~0
comprehension, scaffold  fixed    0.1921   <- expected ~0.25
  This says whether the scaffold was wired as specified. It is the wiring
  read back to us, and it is not evidence of anything the hen learned.

--- SECONDARY, exploratory ---------------------------------------------
strikes/hen, S - N              -47.64 +/- 84.42 SE   noise (t=0.56)
  INNATE if negative. The scaffold suppresses pecking on hearing a call, so
  she raises her head and may see the hawk herself -- reflex, not learning.
  Pre-registered as innate. Must not be reported as evidence for H4.
hunger, S - N                   -0.012 +/- 0.020 SE   noise (t=0.62)
  positive = the scaffold costs her foraging time. It is context-blind: she
  stops pecking at every call she hears, warranted or not.
audience effect, S+L - N+L      +0.060 +/- 0.002 SE   SIGNIFICANT
  Confounded on purpose -- mixes wiring and learning. Reported so the
  difference from the primary is visible, not as a claim.

wall clock: 1096 s
